cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Si usas pobecu, cítalo así. / If you use pobecu, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pobecu: Population of Ecuador by Province, Canton and Parish (Población del Ecuador por Provincia, Cantón y Parroquia)"
abstract: >-
  Official population estimates and projections of Ecuador published by the
  National Institute of Statistics and Censuses (INEC), Revision 2024, by
  province, canton, sex, age and urban/rural area, identified by the codes of
  the political-administrative division (DPA), plus a parish-level estimate
  consistent with the official cantonal projections and helpers to compute
  rates and join population denominators to case tables.
authors:
